Use io.
A record Ledger has an opening (a whole number), a rate (a whole number), and a closing (a whole number).
Let ledger be Ledger.
Update ledger so its opening is 1028, its rate is 8, and its closing is ledger's opening plus ledger's opening times ledger's rate divided by 100.
Let change be ledger's closing minus ledger's opening.
Say change.
Add ledger's rate to it.
Say it.
Add 21 to change.
Say change.
Give back 0.
